---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/Sections/PageHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about our school and our instructor."
>
  <PageHeader 
    title="About Us" 
    backgroundImage="/uploads/about-header.png"
  />
  
  <!-- About Dojang -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <img 
            src="/uploads/tkma-round-logo.jpg"
            alt="TKMA Round Logo" 
            class="rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Tiger Kicks Martial Arts</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">
            Master Lee’s Tiger Kicks Martial Arts is a Taekwondo studio in Warminster, PA. We have been in the Warminster area since since 2017. The studio is founded and run by Master Jookyeong Lee, a world class Taekwondo Athlete who has taught and competed at the national level in South Korea, and has decades of experience teaching martial arts in the United States.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">
            We offer programs and classes for all skill levels. From our Junior Tiger and Tiger Cubs classes aimed to give a fun, friendly experience learning martials arts for young children, to our Family and Black Belt Classes for more experienced individuals, we aim to provide the best instruction and care for all of our students. We are dedicated to not only teaching more about Taekwondo, but to also give out students better confidence, discipline, and focus!
          </p>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
    
  <!-- About Master Lee -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Instructor Jookyeong Lee</h2>
          <h4 class="text-1xl md:text-2xl text-primary-700 mb-6">Biography</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">
            Born in Seoul, South Korea, Master Jookyeong Lee has had a passion for TaeKwonDo from a young age, and attended YongIn University in Seoul, South Korea for TaeKwonDo. He has competed and taught at many competitions, even at the national level in Korea. He moved to the US in 2013 to spread his love and knowledge of Taekwondo, and opened his own martial arts studio in Warminster in 2017.
          </p>
          <h4 class="text-1xl md:text-2xl text-primary-700 mb-6">Accomplishments</h2>
          <ul class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>7th Degree in Taekwondo (World Taekwondo Headquarters Kukkiwon Dan Certificate)</li>
            <li>Graduated from YongIn University </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <img 
            src="/uploads/master-lee.jpg"
            alt="Instructor Jookyeong Lee" 
            class="rounded-lg shadow-lg object-cover w-full h-full"
          />
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
</BaseLayout>